        "        \"Pod Disruption Budgets configured to ensure a minimum number of pods are available during voluntary disruptions (like rolling updates).\",\n",
        "        \"Configuration managed separately from code (e.g., using Kubernetes ConfigMaps and Secrets or external configuration management tools). Updates to configuration trigger rolling updates.\",\n",
        "        \"Containerized agents and LLM interface components.\",\n",
        "        \"Automated CI/CD pipeline for building, testing, and deploying container images to the EKS cluster.\"\n",
        "    ],\n",
        "    \"rollback_plan\": \"Kubernetes Deployments allow easy rollback to a previous stable version if a new deployment causes issues.\"\n",
