        "        \"Monitor resource utilization trends (CPU, Memory, Network, Disk) for agents, Kafka brokers, and the LLM endpoint.\",\n",
        "        \"Periodically review and adjust resource requests and limits in Kubernetes deployments.\",\n",
        "        \"Plan for scaling Kafka partitions and brokers, agent replicas, and LLM endpoint capacity based on projected load and historical data.\"\n",
