        "## Select infrastructure as code (iac) tool\n",
        "\n",
        "### Subtask:\n",
        "Choose an appropriate IaC tool (e.g., Terraform, Pulumi, CloudFormation).\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
