        "Append the Terraform configuration to `main.tf` to include the Kubernetes resources for deploying the monitoring stack, including the monitoring namespace, Helm releases for Prometheus and Grafana, and potentially Service/Ingress resources, using the Kubernetes and Helm providers already configured.\n",
