        "13. Other agents (e.g., Data Analysis, Troubleshooting) consume 'interpreted\\_user\\_query' messages and perform relevant actions.\n",
        "14. Responding agents publish result messages (e.g., 'data\\_insight', 'troubleshooting\\_suggestion').\n",
