        "*   `message_id`: Unique identifier for the message.\n",
        "*   `type`: Indicates the message type (e.g., `anomaly_alert`, `analyzed_alert`, `raw_data_message`, `validation_rule_suggestion`).\n",
        "*   `timestamp`: Time of message creation.\n",
        "*   `source`: Name of the agent that published the message.\n",
        "*   `payload` or specific fields (e.g., `details`, `original_alert`, `suggested_rules`): The actual data content of the message.\n",
        "*   `llm_analysis`: Field to include results from LLM interactions relevant to the message.\n",
        "\n",
